4090/ss_e3fc5d085c45ebb42e02a1b060cb653cbd60f1a9.600x338.jpg?t=1764011596"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754090/ss_7e780297dbb3b6afb572e34eada04d666151665f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764011596","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754090/ss_7e780297dbb3b6afb572e34eada04d666151665f.600x338.jpg?t=1764011596"}],"short_description":"Experience the thrill of aerial combat like never before with Aces of Thunder, the upcoming VR flight simulation game with high fidelity graphics made specifically with capabilities of latest generation VR helmets in mind.","steam_appid":2754090,"support_info":{"email":"https://support.gaijin.net/","url":"https://support.gaijin.net/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://acesofthunder.com/"}